    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71990" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀγμεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>move in a straight line,</i> prop. of ploughers or mowers, <i><span class="en">
