				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγμος</span>
			 : metaph., c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίβον</span>
			<i>plough</i> or <i>trail one's weary</i> way, of a lame man,
